{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有。X在S01、S05等停留时间短的段落里，感受句偏密，扫读负担明显大于Y；Y的因果叙述也更顺口。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X的话语有放大加亮的关键词，能较快抓住每段心理转折；感受又能随音乐到点出现，具体呈现喜欢、克制、失重、酸楚与释然之间的细微区别。反复出现的水波、小船、悬着与落稳，也让十四段像同一段经历在不断变化。Y的左侧叙事更流畅、更容易快速通读，因果关系有时也交代得更自然，但右侧大量短词容易变成情绪标签，削弱了音乐瞬间与人物内心之间的具体联系。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8320c7bc-d5d3-455d-8af4-897be9999736", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T041100457702Z", "elapsed_seconds": 95.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:12:35.788263+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7b155dd2ec09394e700b67fff877cbde3a99200ab3626a0fafe96ec048b71d79", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screen